    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676930/extras/f4f783440365ccc5c489407b5cf067ba.avif?t=1747667709\" width=750 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An office worker with a <strong>traumatic past</strong>, the protagonist  is nearly fired from their job and collapses from stress. They awake to find themselves in a strange environment, with a <strong>beautiful young woman</strong> standing before them. It is revealed that she is a <strong>succubus</strong>, and you have been summoned to this world to become her partner...</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you embrace a new life in this foreign, dangerous world, or search for a return to a familiar - but difficult - life back on Earth?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bond with your succubus companion, encounter new foes and allies, and gradually evolve into a powerful spellsword.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Male or Female protagonist </strong>to choose between. Both playthroughs offer completely different sex scenes.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training system</strong>. Raise and level up your succubus companion's sexual stats, which will in turn unlock new sex positions and sex acts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three main heroines</strong>. Pursue your favorite girl, or start a harem with all three and numerous side heroines. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark fantasy world</strong>. Your actions have consequences, and it is possible to be injured or even killed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Statistics</strong> for both you and your succubus companion. The number of people slept with, days passed, and much more will be continually updated &amp; available to view.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676930/extras/28d04e0da466a53dcb2ce681dd3dc6a4.poster.avif?t=1747667709\" width=500 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676930/extras/28d04e0da466a53dcb2ce681dd3dc6a4.webm?t=1747667709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676930/extras/28d04e0da466a53dcb2ce681dd3dc6a4.mp4?t=1747667709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sexual Content:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vaginal &amp; Anal Sex, Lesbian Sex, Exhibitionism, Sex Toys, Feet Play, and much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional</strong> kinks include BDSM, prostitution, and consensual non-monogamy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main succubus heroine, you can also have sex with other characters!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676930/extras/85c27e2971fb926b64ee3585070223d1.avif?t=1747667709\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p>",
